{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"马达加斯加","country_iso":"MDG","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:56:58.499926","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"MDG-HB-0002","ldc":"Yes","location":"塔马塔夫","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"马达加斯加GALLOIS石墨矿一号矿一期光伏项目","project_name_en":"Madagascar GALLOIS Graphite Mine Mine No.1 Phase I PV Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"山东高速路桥国际","content":"近日，山东高速路桥国际公司承建的马达加斯加GALLIOS石墨矿一号矿一期光伏项目正式开工。标志着公司首个海外大规模光伏项目的启动，也是公司与马达加斯加GALLOIS公司新能源领域合作的重要里程碑，助力GALLOIS石墨矿一号矿的矿区能源转型迈出了重要一步。\n该项目位于马达加斯加塔马塔夫Tamatave，光伏项目占地80,000平方米，采用“光伏+储能+柴油发电”综合能源模式，配备先进的光伏技术设备，一期装机容量为7.98MW，日均发电量3.06万kWh，并配置4MW/8MWh储能系统。计划于2025年7月1日投入使用，届时将为矿区的成品厂提供稳定电力供应，节省生产用电成本，解决矿区单一发电模式的弊端，实现绿色、可持续的矿区能源供应。\n下一步，公司将以此项目为契机，积累海外新能源业务实施经验，持续提升综合竞争力，不断创新业务合作模式，拓展多元业务赛道，推动公司国际业务高质量可持续发展。","content_sha256":"4c752dfed22693def42d302a3690d0f7cae3f16bb75bb7edc00194f494714d13","id":4573,"publish_date":"2025-02-25 08:11:43","title":"山东高速路桥国际公司承建马达加斯加GALLOIS石墨矿光伏项目正式开工","title_sha256":"9ae1740a5be99d323195fa17728dfe405aeeba5ecfc592c3b78c1fa1739598a6","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/79163.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"MDG-HB-0002","capacity_details":"PV: 7.98MW, BESS: 4MW/8MWh","capacity_mw":7.98,"capacity_mw_raw":"7.98","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:56:58.500036","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"MDG-HB-0002-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.sdlqgf.com/mobile.php/News/view/id/2826.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"2025-07-01","planned_start_date":"2025-02-25","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project